# Copy to .privacy-terms and fill in. That file is gitignored, because the
# terms it holds are exactly what must never be committed.
#
# One term per line, matched case-insensitively on word boundaries across
# every file the scanner reads. Lines starting with # are ignored.
#
# Put here anything that identifies a customer or a real environment:
#
#   Contoso
#   Contoso Financial
#   pve-prod-dc1
#   corp.contoso.example
#   CONTOSO-CORE-SW01
